<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; border: 2px solid #1a5276; padding: 10px; border-radius: 8px; background-color: #eaf2f8;">
    <h1 style="color: #1a5276; text-align: center; margin-top: 0;">Lesson Planner – Theme # The Habitat of Wildlife – Lesson # 1</h1>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: #333;">Complete this planner five times per theme, once per lesson (Lesson 1 through Lesson 5).</p>
</div>

<h2 style="color: #1a5276; margin-top: 25px;">SECTION 2 — LESSON IDENTIFICATION TABLE</h2>
